ody":"","tags":["Level-5"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":1,"deletions":1},"md":{"insertions":8,"deletions":0}}},{"hash":"365bb6904d92265f567c1a7f5b2a20482997c945","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"DobbyLogic: Add delete functionality","messageBody":"","tags":["Level-6"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":33,"deletions":1}}}]},{"date":"2026-09-04T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"058e7e4add17c6d4a20860bd4137e4d82f5f8917","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add basic write tasks to txt file functionality","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":63,"deletions":0},"md":{"insertions":10,"deletions":10}}},{"hash":"6f5bed696ea1626e65622bcc2295418b3313ae54","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add load functionality and error handlings","messageBody":"","tags":["Level-7"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":129,"deletions":6},"md":{"insertions":228,"deletions":7}}},{"hash":"dbcc33add6de39f6702c04ea9352c6a3b31db75f","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Change dates and times format from String to LocalDate","messageBody":"","tags":["Level-8"],"fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":156,"deletions":24},"md":{"insertions":57,"deletions":57}}},{"hash":"c822952c4b7ebee799a6b387f06ad36482df8496","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract task list operations from DobbyLogic","messageBody":"Introduce TaskList as the owner of in-memory task storage and basic add, retrieve, remove, size, and persistence-copy operations. DobbyLogic now delegates collection management while retaining command behavior, which reduces its responsibilities without altering console output. Update the UI test-plan compilation commands to include the new class.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":56,"deletions":7},"md":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"c1f011a580ef864189fcef5ea970d64eccbecc64","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract console interactions into Ui","messageBody":"Move standard-input handling and the welcome, prompt, divider, and farewell output from Dobby into Ui. Dobby now coordinates the application loop while Ui owns console interaction, establishing the boundary needed for future command objects to report results without coupling themselves to System.in or System.out. Update UI test-plan compilation commands to include Ui.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":59,"deletions":22},"md":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"1cf7b15f357c5f1138f6ad9857e6497375d9b119","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Introduce parser and list command","messageBody":"Add the Command abstraction, ListCommand, and Parser. Valid list input now becomes a ListCommand that delegates task display to DobbyLogic, establishing a small command-object execution path while retaining existing handling for the remaining commands. Rename DobbyLogic\u0027s internal enum to CommandType to distinguish it from the new abstraction, and update UI test-plan compilation commands.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":67,"deletions":14},"md":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"8b235f9023e6002db5ad927339a1e2b01dcb8aee","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Route exit handling through ExitCommand","messageBody":"Add ExitCommand and extend Parser to recognize bye. Dobby now parses each input once, exits based on Command.isExit(), and executes recognized commands in the application loop; commands not yet extracted still delegate to DobbyLogic. Remove the former special isBye check and update UI test-plan compile commands.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":26,"deletions":12},"md":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"79e26d47f999c0733a8bd6e10c5efd1c89e518c3","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract mark and unmark commands","messageBody":"Add MarkCommand and UnmarkCommand, each carrying a one-based task number parsed from valid mark or unmark input. Move shared completion-status behavior into DobbyLogic.changeTaskStatus while retaining existing fallback validation and error messages for malformed commands. Update the UI test-plan compilation commands.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":75,"deletions":9},"md":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"80400e3d30ec87d0e556b573dbb77e8f91abe14c","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract delete command","messageBody":"Add DeleteCommand to represent valid delete commands with a one-based task number. Parser now constructs it for valid input, while DobbyLogic.deleteTask centralizes deletion validation, persistence, and the established confirmation message. Malformed delete input still uses the existing fallback validation path. Update UI test-plan compilation commands.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":38,"deletions":6},"md":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"a5d7a7fb599624ddf20f9cbf6ca993313649cdb7","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Extract todo deadline and event commands","messageBody":"Add TodoCommand, DeadlineCommand, and EventCommand to represent valid task-creation requests and their parsed data. Extend Parser to recognize valid task descriptions, markers, and dates, while malformed inputs continue to use DobbyLogic\u0027s established validation messages. The logic class retains task creation and persistence operations. Update UI test-plan compilation commands.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":131,"deletions":0},"md":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"bbd4ebe37d953a0aeac915d9893c9637a11efa33","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Centralize command errors in Parser","messageBody":"Make Parser return a command for every non-EOF input, including InvalidCommand for blank, unknown, malformed, and invalid-date commands. Dobby now always executes the parsed command, removing the runtime fallback from the application loop. InvalidCommand preserves the established console messages through DobbyLogic.showMessage, while existing task commands retain their domain operations.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":80,"deletions":69}}},{"hash":"813d7377d52784731746a641779664911bf87939","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Remove legacy parsing from DobbyLogic","messageBody":"Delete the unused command-token parsing, command enum, validation helpers, and date parsing from DobbyLogic. The class now applies task operations, handles persistence, and displays command-provided messages, while Parser and command objects own input interpretation. Preserve the existing task behavior and console output.\n","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":30,"deletions":227}}}]},{"date":"2026-09-05T00:00:00","commitResults":[{"hash":"7ea4d93842d89b19cf06d0a499bbf250f6c8b896","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Add comment for regex and minor styling","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":11,"deletions":19}}},{"hash":"4f10cc00e26ec2ad9b207e9dbe385f7a9f04122e","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Introduce DobbyException","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":62,"deletions":33},"md":{"insertions":8,"deletions":8}}},{"hash":"6f090845730eb1756029d579a47b94a32f0b8594","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Remove ui-test-session.md","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"md":{"insertions":0,"deletions":361}}},{"hash":"6e34b6381a1e26f840c519086a4bae65d1bd9344","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Refactor Command.java and add InvalidCommand.java","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":22,"deletions":17},"md":{"insertions":4,"deletions":4}}},{"hash":"be37fee7fc529736ee4348562a8677b37d9d9c01","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Move *.java into dobby/","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndContributionMap":{"java":{"insertions":25,"deletions":211}}},{"hash":"dcb15f48eef1cab2a1e49c117bfb24133c4404c1","isMergeCommit":false,"messageTitle":"Refactor for Ui.java","messageBody":"","fileTypesAndCont